.el .ds Aq '
.TH agent-sandbox 1  "agent-sandbox 0.2.0" 
.SH NAME
agent\-sandbox \- Hardened Kernel\-Level Mandatory Access Control & Isolation for AI Agents on macOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBagent\-sandbox\fR [\fB\-v \fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hardened Kernel\-Level Mandatory Access Control & Isolation for AI Agents on macOS
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Print version information (\-v)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-run(1)
Execute an isolated command inside the Apple Seatbelt kernel sandbox
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-shell(1)
Launch an interactive sandboxed shell (zsh/bash) with ephemeral session storage
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-doctor(1)
Audit system security controls and in\-memory kernel sandbox
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-test(1)
Execute automated security isolation regression test suite (12 invariants)
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-broker(1)
Hardware and macOS capability broker interface
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-mcp(1)
Run Model Context Protocol (MCP) stdio server
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-version(1)
Print version information
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-completions(1)
Generate shell autocompletion script (bash, zsh, fish, powershell)
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-man(1)
Render Unix roff man page documentation to stdout
.TP
agent\-sandbox\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.0
